# Keep the Docker build context small and free of secrets and personal data.
# The images install their own node_modules from the lockfile.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.vite
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
.git
.github

# Secrets and local settings. Pass configuration at run time instead.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example

# Real contracts and local data never go into an image. Unlike .gitignore, a pattern here
# matches only at the root of the build context, so "**/" is needed to also catch nested
# folders such as apps/api/.data or evals/private. No image needs a PDF, so none goes in.
**/private/
**/.data/
**/*.pdf
evals/results/

# Not needed to build or run the app.
docs/
evals/cases/
infra/docker-compose.yml
